{"2743790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LOVEJUICED! -Hi Neighbor, meet Gamer.-", "steam_appid": 2743790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medium-length visual novel with multiple heroines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush artwork, detailed event scenes, and 2D anime-style sprites </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vignette-style slice-of-life focused on cozy college friendships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced by a veteran cast of professional Japanese VAs </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all started with a mobile game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just random, anonymous chats online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing serious—just dumb jokes and girl trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like my hopeless crush on the older girl on campus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s the harm, right? It’s not like we’d ever meet in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except the next day...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“WHAAAAAAAAAAAT?!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“YOU’RE ALL GIIIIIIIIIRLS?!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And not just any girls—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They’re my age, go to my college... and live in my building?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As in, they’ve been right next door this whole time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s how the summer I’ll never forget began.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743790/extras/12666b4d016a590ec5ba4423479ca3ac.avif?t=1782698147\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momoka Taguchi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ari Kitano</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part of your all-male-turned-female chat group.<br>A year older than you, she’s upbeat, active and easy to talk to...<br>Works part-time at the café on the first floor of your building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743790/extras/3cc266aff58eaabe09e17391eb196e73.avif?t=1782698147\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Akari Mizushima</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Misuzu Fuurin</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The older girl you’ve been crushing on who’s also one year older.<br>Happens to be best friends with Aoi, so you see her around a lot...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743790/extras/3492e682171ac06b4c49a652cb49e004.avif?t=1782698147\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiyori Kojima</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nana Hiiragi</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of your online “bros.”<br>Carefree and bubbly, she never seems to act her age.<br>Her airheaded ways tend to land you in constant trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743790/extras/d929f5f3b75bd138f7f781f063435310.avif?t=1782698147\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aoi Hayasaka</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hanami Takanashi</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another of your online “bros.”<br>Blunt, casual, and clueless about how she screws with your head.<br>Like with Hiyori, it’s been becoming kind of a problem...</p>", "about_the_game": "<